<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shortlisted - Great News!</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff;">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16a34a 0%, #15803d 100%); padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center;">
            {{#if companyLogo}}
            <img src="{{companyLogo}}" alt="{{organizationName}}" style="max-height: 50px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            {{/if}}
            <h1 style="color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600;">🌟 Great News!</h1>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div style="padding: 40px 30px;">
            <h2 style="color: #16a34a; margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600;">
                You've been shortlisted, {{candidateName}}!
            </h2>
            
            <p style="margin: 0 0 25px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;">
                We're pleased to inform you that you've been shortlisted for the <strong style="color: #16a34a;">{{jobTitle}}</strong> position at {{organizationName}}.
            </p>
            
            <!-- Achievement Badge -->
            <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dcfce7 0%, #bbf7d0 100%); padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 25px 0; border: 1px solid #16a34a; text-align: center;">
                <div style="font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 15px;">🏆</div>
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #166534; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">
                    Outstanding Application
                </h3>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #15803d; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;">
                    Your application stood out among many qualified candidates. We're impressed by your qualifications and experience.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <p style="margin: 25px 0; color: #374151; font-size: 16px;">
                Being shortlisted means you're now part of a select group of top candidates we're seriously considering for this role.
            </p>
            
            <div style="background-color: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #22c55e; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <h4 style="margin: 0 0 15px; color: #166534; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">
                    What happens next?
                </h4>
                <ul style="margin: 0; color: #15803d; font-size: 15px; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">We'll be reviewing all shortlisted applications in detail</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Selected candidates will be contacted for interviews within 5-7 business days</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Keep an eye on your inbox and phone for our next communication</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div style="background-color: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0; text-align: center;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #92400e; font-size: 15px;">
                    <strong>💡 Stay Ready:</strong> We recommend preparing for potential interviews by reviewing common questions and researching our company culture and values.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <p style="margin: 25px 0; color: #374151; font-size: 16px;">
                Thank you for your interest in joining our team. We're excited about the possibility of working together!
            </p>
            
            <p style="margin: 20px 0 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; font-style: italic; text-align: center;">
                We appreciate your patience as we carefully review all applications to make the best hiring decisions.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #374151; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;">
                Best regards,
            </p>
            <p style="margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px;">
                {{organizationName}} Hiring Team
            </p>
            
            <div style="margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;">
                    This email was sent regarding your application for {{jobTitle}}.<br>
                    Please do not reply to this email. For questions, contact our HR team directly.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
